  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "tEA2Xm5dHt1r"
   },
   "source": [
    "#### 1. State Your research hypothesis as a null hypothesis and alternate hypothesis."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "HI9ZP0laH0D-"
   },
   "source": [
    "Research hypothesis: The average bike count in Seoul city at any point of time is greater than 100.\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "*   Null hypothesis H0: Average = 100.\n",
    "*   Alternate hypothesis Ha: Average > 100.\n",
    "\n",
    "\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "I79__PHVH19G"
   },
   "source": [
    "#### 2. Perform an appropriate statistical test."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "oZrfquKtyian"
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Perform Statistical Test to obtain P-Value\n",
    "\n",
    "rented_bike_count_sample = df['Rented_Bike_Count'].sample(500)\n",
    "rented_bike_count_mean = np.mean(rented_bike_count_sample)\n",
    "rented_bike_count_std = np.std(rented_bike_count_sample)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {
    "colab": {
     "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
    },
    "id": "TA7fgPEJiIK8",
    "outputId": "0392a5fb-6621-447f-f4bf-05ddde31937b"
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Computing test statistic\n",
    "\n",
    "ts = (rented_bike_count_mean-100)/(rented_bike_count_std/(np.sqrt(500)))\n",
    "ts"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {
    "colab": {
     "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
    },
    "id": "GPlbDwMliwKZ",
    "outputId": "f438959d-cd56-4c29-9595-26082c78c78e"
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Calculating the probability\n",
    "prob_z = norm.cdf(9.3441, 0, 1)\n",
    "print(prob_z)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {
    "colab": {
     "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
    },
    "id": "WFt5VqMdjW6P",
    "outputId": "7bac124b-de80-48a6-fea1-38a2aac8c83a"
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# P-Value\n",
    "p1 = 1-prob_z\n",
    "p1"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "Ou-I18pAyIpj"
   },
   "source": [
    "##### Which statistical test have you done to obtain P-Value?"
   ]
  },
